2026-09-08,windows,winui,P47,ok,-,window,default,"symbols: 36 of 36 drawn as real Segoe glyphs, reported by the Windows side 2026-09-08 from winui-P47-20260908-021847.png. Named individually rather than counted: add=plus, delete=trash, warning=triangle, info=circled i, phone=handset, mail=envelope. The capture carries its own control: definitely.not.a.symbol, which is in no table, draws as its own text -- so 'they are icons' is separated from 'something appeared' by the picture itself. This row was launch=ok with an empty note until now, and launch=ok reads identically whether the 36 are glyphs or empty boxes, which is the failure the whole feature exists to prevent"
2026-09-08,ios,uikit,P45,ok,ok,window,unrecorded,"press-the-computed-binding-toggle: replayed 7 actions, XCUITest EXECUTE SUCCEEDED. Coordinates measured by scanning the capture and then drawing the detected spans back over it to check they bound the right controls: seed buttons at (65,666) and (183,666) pt, the honest toggle at (353,416) pt, second of three grey pills at x 983..1135 px. RESULT: sibling state survived -- selection 2, typed seeded -- with honest true and setter writes 1, button presses 0. The subtree rebuild SoftPCB reported on macOS does not reproduce on iOS"
2026-09-08,android,android,P45,ok,ok,window,unrecorded,"press-the-computed-binding-toggle: replayed 7 actions at scale 2.625. Coordinates from a uiautomator dump, which names every control: honest ToggleButton [42,806][273,932], selection=2 [42,1696][370,1822], typed=seeded [391,1696][771,1822], divided by density 2.625. RESULT: sibling state survived -- selection 2, typed seeded -- with honest true and setter writes 1, button presses 0. The subtree rebuild SoftPCB reported on macOS does not reproduce on Android. NOTE the build needs SCUI_DEBUG=1; without it AndroidBackend compiles the replay call out and the run looks identical to a passing one"
2026-09-08,ios,uikit,P6,ok,ok,window,unrecorded,"effect diagnosis -- by design: the action file contains no click at all -- this scenario asserts that a notice is on screen, so an unchanged screen is the expected result rather than a defect. Diagnosed 2026-09-08 by projecting each click at 3:1 onto the control capture and asking whether anything but background sits within 40x30 px of it. The ten no-change apps are three different situations, not one: two press nothing by design, five carry coordinates measured 2026-09-02 that the layout has since moved out from under, and three land on a control and still change nothing."
